# CarStats Mobile — environment variable template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# The app currently needs no keys of its own. Everything that needs one goes
# through the API server, where the keys live in the API's
# appsettings.Production.json (gitignored):
#   - AI (vehicle specs, fault explanations): Ai:GroqKey, Ai:GeminiKey
#   - Google Maps (trip planner, mechanic finder): GoogleMaps:ApiKey
